gitpulse — a local, self-contained picture of when you actually shipped.

Scans your repos, reads git log, writes one standalone HTML file.
No server or dependencies. Interactive runs refresh remotes first.

  gitpulse             fetch, regenerate, and open the page
  gitpulse --no-fetch  use local refs, regenerate, and open
  gitpulse --no-open   fetch and regenerate without opening
"""

